## 🎯 Overview

ShopEasy is a microservices-based e-commerce platform demonstrating modern distributed system patterns. Instead of a monolithic application, the system is divided into independent, loosely-coupled services that communicate via REST APIs and service discovery.

### Why Microservices?

| Monolith Problems | Microservices Solutions |
|-------------------|------------------------|
| Single point of failure | Independent services - one failure doesn't crash all |
| Hard to scale | Scale individual services based on demand |
| Technology lock-in | Each service can use different tech stack |
| Slow deployments | Deploy services independently |
| Team bottlenecks | Teams own their services |

